{"_v":1,"id":"the-color-purple-2005","cs":81,"rc":5,"bd":{"positive":4,"mixed":1,"negative":0},"rv":[{"cn":"Alissa Wilkinson","o":"The New York Times","s":92,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.nytimes.com/2007/05/18/theater/reviews/18purp.html","d":"2007-05-18","q":"“The Color Purple” has been born again, and its conversion is a glory to behold.","dg":"Critics_Pick"},{"cn":"Charles Isherwood","o":"Variety","s":64,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://variety.com/2005/legit/reviews/the-color-purple-1200524646/","d":"2005-12-02","q":"Like everything else in the show, the musical elements are a far-from-seamless mix, alternating flat stretches with stirring peaks, and too many songs feel incomplete."},{"cn":"Matthew Murray","o":"Talkin' Broadway","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.talkinbroadway.com/page/regional/boston/b530.html","d":"2005-12-12","q":"The Color Purple is a show that succeeds not because of its individual parts, but because of how beautifully those parts work together to create something greater than the sum of its components."},{"cn":"Ross Bonaime","o":"TheWrap","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.thewrap.com/the-color-purple-review-fantasia-barrino-danielle-brooks/","q":"Brooks and Henson are giving performances that put their own spin on these characters in truly wonderful ways."},{"cn":"Eric March","o":"Theater Life","s":94,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"https://theaterlife.com/the-color-purple/","d":"2007-01-18","q":"Making an impressive Broadway debut director Gary Griffin has turned The Color Purple into a glorious rarity, a pure life affirming entertainment that is a thrill to behold."}],"au":{"score":79,"designation":"Liking","sources":{"mz":{"s":79,"c":48,"sr":3.9}}},"hi":"/images/shows/the-color-purple-2005/hero.webp","ta":"1681 Broadway, New York, NY 10019","pd":"2005-11-01","ca":[{"n":"LaChanze","r":"Celie"},{"n":"Brandon Victor Dixon","r":"Harpo"},{"n":"Felicia P. Fields","r":"Sofia"},{"n":"Renée Elise Goldsberry","r":"Nettie"},{"n":"Ki